---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy for growrevenue.co Forms | Grow Revenue"
  description="What The Grow Revenue Company collects through growrevenue.co, where it is stored, who processes it, how long we keep it and how to have it deleted."
  path="/privacy/" pageType="trust" crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy policy', path: '/privacy/' }]}>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:150px"><div class="narrow prose">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.2rem)">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated October 26, 2026. This policy explains what {SITE.legalName} ("we") collects through growrevenue.co and what we do with it. We are the data controller. Contact: <a href={'mailto:' + SITE.email}>{SITE.email}</a>, {SITE.address.street}, {SITE.address.city} {SITE.address.postcode}, United Kingdom.</p>
    <h2>What do we collect?</h2>
    <p>Only what you type into the contact form: your name, business email, website, the topic you choose, your message and, if you give it, your monthly email volume. We also record the date and time you sent it.</p>
    <p>For site statistics we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not identify individual visitors. This site sets no tracking or advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Why do we use it, and on what legal basis?</h2>
    <p>To reply to your enquiry and, if you ask us to, to prepare a proposal. The legal basis is your consent, given with the checkbox on the form, and our legitimate interest in answering business enquiries. We do not add you to a mailing list and we do not sell or share your details for marketing.</p>
    <h2>Who processes it for us?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong> hosts the site and stores form submissions in a Cloudflare D1 database.</li>
      <li><strong>Telegram</strong> delivers a notification of each new enquiry to Kunal Arora.</li>
      <li><strong>Google (Google Workspace)</strong> hosts our email, where our replies to you are kept.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Some of these providers process data outside the UK and EU. They do so under the UK International Data Transfer Addendum or the EU Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>
    <h2>How long do we keep it?</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are deleted 24 months after our last contact with you, unless you become a client, in which case we keep business records for as long as UK law requires.</p>
    <h2>What are your rights?</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, object to how we use it, or withdraw consent at any time by emailing <a href={'mailto:' + SITE.email}>{SITE.email}</a>. We reply within one month. You can also complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
